  journalLore: 'In the bog villages they leave the last fish of a catch on the bank. Not for luck: so the bog troll takes that one, and not the one who caught it.'
  journalAdvice: 'It spits poison from a distance: close in fast. Its wet hide parts under a blade (weak to slash). Its tongue can''t be blocked: dodge sideways when it rears back, or it drags you in and holds you.'
  journalHabitat: The bogs and meres of the Misty Woods
